{
  "$schema": "./recipe-schema.json",
  "meta": {
    "schemaVersion": "3.1.0",
    "component": "alert-dialog",
    "version": "2.0.0",
    "status": "stable",
    "tags": [
      "overlay",
      "interactive",
      "dialog",
      "confirmation"
    ],
    "links": {
      "figma": "",
      "storybook": "",
      "docs": "/docs/alert-dialog-docs"
    },
    "changelog": [
      {
        "version": "2.0.0",
        "changes": [
          "Semantisches Icon: Optionaler Icon-Slot im Header (z.B. rotes Warnsymbol bei destructive)",
          "Destructive-Modifier (.nc-alert-dialog--destructive): CSS-Klasse fuer danger-spezifische Styles",
          "Destructive Token-Gruppe: danger-icon-color, danger-action-bg, danger-action-color als eigene tokenGroup",
          "Icon-Token: --nc-dialog-icon-size (24px) fuer konsistente Icon-Groesse",
          "Visuelle Konsistenz: Danger-Farben identisch mit Alert-Danger fuer semantische Kohaerenz",
          "Autofocus-Cancel: Best-Practice — Cancel autofocus bei destructive verhindert Slipping-Fehler"
        ]
      },
      {
        "version": "1.0.0",
        "changes": [
          "Initiales Recipe: 2 Intents, natives <dialog>, Fokus-Trap, ESC-Close, Body-Scroll-Lock"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "layer": "organism",
    "pipeline": {
      "scss": [
        "scss/scss/07-organisms/_alert-dialog.scss"
      ],
      "story": "stories/organisms/alert-dialog.stories.js",
      "arena": "apps/theme-configurator/src/components/laboratory/AlertDialogArena.vue",
      "drupal": [],
      "docs": "docs/alert-dialog-docs.html"
    },
    "dependencies": [
      "alert"
    ]
  },
  "anatomy": {
    "root": {
      "element": ".nc-alert-dialog"
    },
    "slots": [
      {
        "name": "icon",
        "element": ".nc-alert-dialog__icon",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "header",
        "element": ".nc-alert-dialog__header",
        "optional": false
      },
      {
        "name": "title",
        "element": ".nc-alert-dialog__title",
        "optional": false
      },
      {
        "name": "description",
        "element": ".nc-alert-dialog__description",
        "optional": true
      },
      {
        "name": "footer",
        "element": ".nc-alert-dialog__footer",
        "optional": false
      }
    ],
    "convenience": [],
    "domNotes": [
      "Root: natives <dialog> Element. showModal() fuer modale Anzeige.",
      "Verwendet --nc-dialog-* Tokens (geteilt mit Modal und Drawer).",
      "Icon-Slot (v2.0): Optionales Status-Icon vor dem Header. Bei destructive: rotes Warnsymbol (nc-dialog-danger-icon-color). Verstaerkt visuelle Dringlichkeit.",
      "Header: flex-column, Title + Description. Gap via header-gap.",
      "Footer: flex, justify-end, Cancel + Action Buttons.",
      "[open]: display:flex. Zentriert via fixed + margin:auto.",
      "Backdrop: ::backdrop mit overlay-bg Fade-in Animation.",
      "Body Scroll Lock: body:has(.nc-alert-dialog[open]) { overflow: hidden }.",
      "Destructive-Modifier: .nc-alert-dialog--destructive setzt Icon-Farbe auf danger und styled Action-Button als Danger-Button.",
      "Focus-Management: Bei default: autofocus auf Action-Button (primaere Aktion). Bei destructive: autofocus auf Cancel-Button (verhindert versehentliches Loeschen = Anti-Slipping-Pattern).",
      "Visuelle Synergie: Danger-Farben (bg, border, icon-color) sind identisch mit .nc-alert--danger, sodass ein Danger-Alert im Formular visuell exakt zum darauf folgenden Destructive-Alert-Dialog passt."
    ]
  },
  "axes": {
    "intent": {
      "label": "Intent",
      "description": "Intention — default (neutral, informativ), destructive (Loeschen/Gefahr, visuell hervorgehoben)",
      "values": {
        "default": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "alert-dialog-default"
        },
        "destructive": {
          "modifier": "nc-alert-dialog--destructive",
          "tokenGroups": [
            "danger"
          ],
          "renderHint": "alert-dialog-destructive"
        }
      }
    },
    "content": {
      "label": "Content",
      "description": "Inhalt — with-description (Title + Description), title-only (nur Title), with-icon (Title + Description + Status-Icon)",
      "values": {
        "with-description": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "slotConfig": {
            "description": true
          },
          "renderHint": "alert-dialog-description"
        },
        "title-only": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [],
          "renderHint": "alert-dialog-title-only"
        },
        "with-icon": {
          "modifier": null,
          "tokenGroups": [
            "icon"
          ],
          "slotConfig": {
            "icon": true,
            "description": true
          },
          "renderHint": "alert-dialog-with-icon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "states": {
    "supported": [
      "default",
      "open"
    ],
    "precedence": [
      "open",
      "default"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "state": "open",
        "unless": [],
        "note": "Open: display:flex, opacity:1, translate(0,0). Animation via @starting-style."
      }
    ],
    "interactive": true
  },
  "a11y": {
    "base": {
      "interactive": true,
      "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
      "assertions": [
        "hasAccessibleName",
        "supportsKeyboard",
        "focusTrap"
      ],
      "note": "Natives <dialog> liefert role='dialog', aria-modal='true' bei showModal(). aria-labelledby → Title. aria-describedby → Description. ESC schliesst nativ. Fokus-Trap nativ."
    },
    "overrides": [
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "intent": [
              "default"
            ]
          }
        },
        "suggest": [
          "autofocus-action"
        ],
        "note": "Default: autofocus auf Action-Button (primaere Aktion) fuer direkten Keyboard-Zugriff."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "intent": [
              "destructive"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "autofocus-cancel"
        ],
        "note": "Destructive: autofocus auf Cancel-Button statt Action — verhindert Slipping-Fehler (versehentliches Loeschen bei schnellem Enter). Best-Practice fuer destruktive Aktionen."
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "content": [
              "with-icon"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "aria-hidden-icon"
        ],
        "note": "Status-Icon ist dekorativ (aria-hidden='true'). Semantik kommt aus dem Titel und der Beschreibung."
      }
    ]
  },
  "constraints": {
    "rules": [
      {
        "when": {},
        "require": [
          "dialog-element",
          "aria-labelledby"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "<dialog> mit showModal(). aria-labelledby → Title."
        ]
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "content": [
              "with-description",
              "with-icon"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "aria-describedby"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "aria-describedby → Description."
        ]
      },
      {
        "when": {
          "axes": {
            "intent": [
              "destructive"
            ]
          }
        },
        "require": [
          "autofocus-cancel"
        ],
        "notes": [
          "Cancel-Button autofocus bei destructive (Anti-Slipping)."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "copy": {
      "title": {
        "maxChars": 60,
        "note": "Alert-Titel: 'Eintrag loeschen?', 'Sitzung beenden?', 'Aenderungen verwerfen?'."
      },
      "description": {
        "maxChars": 120,
        "note": "Beschreibung: 'Diese Aktion kann nicht rueckgaengig gemacht werden.'"
      }
    }
  },
  "styling": {
    "baseClasses": [
      "nc-alert-dialog"
    ],
    "baseTokenGroups": [
      "container",
      "header",
      "footer"
    ],
    "tokenGroups": {
      "container": {
        "label": "Container",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-dialog-max-width",
          "nc-dialog-padding",
          "nc-dialog-radius",
          "nc-dialog-bg",
          "nc-dialog-shadow",
          "nc-dialog-overlay-bg",
          "nc-dialog-section-gap"
        ]
      },
      "header": {
        "label": "Header",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-dialog-title-font-size",
          "nc-dialog-title-font-weight",
          "nc-dialog-title-color",
          "nc-dialog-header-gap"
        ]
      },
      "footer": {
        "label": "Footer & Description",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-dialog-description-font-size",
          "nc-dialog-description-color",
          "nc-dialog-footer-gap"
        ]
      },
      "icon": {
        "label": "Status Icon",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-dialog-icon-size"
        ]
      },
      "danger": {
        "label": "Destructive Intent",
        "tokens": [
          "nc-dialog-danger-icon-color",
          "nc-dialog-danger-action-bg",
          "nc-dialog-danger-action-color"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "recipes": {
    "mode": "derived",
    "derive": {
      "from": [
        "axes",
        "states",
        "styling.tokenGroups"
      ],
      "output": [
        "classList",
        "resolvedTokens",
        "a11yAssertions"
      ]
    },
    "resolution": {
      "classList": [
        "styling.baseClasses",
        "axes.intent.values.*.modifier"
      ],
      "tokenGroups": [
        "styling.baseTokenGroups",
        "axes.*.values.*.tokenGroups"
      ]
    }
  },
  "specimens": [
    {
      "id": "default",
      "label": "Default Alert Dialog",
      "description": "Neutraler Bestaetigungsdialog mit Title, Description und Buttons",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "intent": [
            "default"
          ],
          "content": [
            "with-description"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "alert-dialog-default",
        "label": "default"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "aria-labelledby → Title. aria-describedby → Description. Action: autofocus."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "destructive",
      "label": "Destructive Alert Dialog",
      "description": "Loeschen-Bestaetigungsdialog mit Danger-Button und Icon",
      "composes": [
        "button"
      ],
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "intent": [
            "destructive"
          ],
          "content": [
            "with-icon"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "focusTokenGroups": [
        "danger",
        "icon"
      ],
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "alert-dialog-destructive",
        "label": "destructive"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Destructive: Cancel autofocus. Danger-Button + Icon visuell hervorgehoben."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "intent-comparison",
      "label": "Intent Comparison",
      "description": "Default vs Destructive (mit Icon)",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "intent": "*",
          "content": [
            "with-icon"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "grid",
      "layoutConfig": {
        "rowAxis": "intent"
      },
      "render": {
        "label": "{intent}"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Default: Action autofocus. Destructive: Cancel autofocus. Icon verstaerkt Intent."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "content-variants",
      "label": "Content Variants",
      "description": "With Description vs Title Only vs With Icon",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "intent": [
            "default"
          ],
          "content": "*"
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "grid",
      "layoutConfig": {
        "rowAxis": "content"
      },
      "render": {
        "label": "{content}"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Title-Only: aria-describedby entfaellt. With-Icon: Icon aria-hidden='true'."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "destructive-with-icon",
      "label": "Destructive with Icon",
      "description": "Destructive-Dialog mit prominentem Warn-Icon — maximale visuelle Dringlichkeit",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "intent": [
            "destructive"
          ],
          "content": [
            "with-icon"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "focusTokenGroups": [
        "danger",
        "icon"
      ],
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "alert-dialog-destructive-icon",
        "label": "destructive + icon"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Icon in Danger-Farbe. aria-hidden='true'. Cancel autofocus."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "session-timeout",
      "label": "Session Timeout",
      "description": "Typisches Pattern: Sitzung abgelaufen, Verlaengern oder Abmelden",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "intent": [
            "default"
          ],
          "content": [
            "with-description"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "alert-dialog-session",
        "label": "session"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "Session-Timeout: Verlaengern autofocus. Timer ggf. als aria-live Region."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "unsaved-changes",
      "label": "Unsaved Changes",
      "description": "Aenderungen verwerfen Dialog mit 3 Buttons",
      "matrix": {
        "axes": {
          "intent": [
            "destructive"
          ],
          "content": [
            "with-description"
          ]
        },
        "states": [
          "default"
        ]
      },
      "layout": "row",
      "render": {
        "compositionType": "alert-dialog-unsaved",
        "label": "unsaved"
      },
      "a11y": {
        "contrastTarget": "WCAG AA normal text (4.5:1)",
        "note": "3 Buttons: Speichern, Verwerfen, Abbrechen. Cancel (Abbrechen) autofocus."
      }
    }
  ]
}
